# Feature pattern

Screen logic lives in `src/features/<kebab-name>/`:

```
src/features/<name>/
  <name>.feature.tsx
  api/                     # optional GraphQL for this feature
  components/              # feature-private UI
  index.ts
```

Routes in `src/app/` stay thin:

```tsx
import { HomeFeature } from "@/features";
export default function HomeScreen() {
  return <HomeFeature />;
}
```

## Naming

- Files: kebab-case with suffix (`*.feature.tsx`, `*.component.tsx`, `*.helpers.ts`)
- Components: PascalCase
- GraphQL docs: SCREAMING_SNAKE (`MY_RESERVATIONS`, `BOOK`)

Tabs (v1): Home | Reservations | Profile. Keep waitlist/owner flows out of the
tab bar unless product asks for them.
